      "updated": 1786039806936,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "PostGIS / OpenSearch / Redis GEO are strong MVP choices.\nAt high movement rates, indexing pressure and read/write coupling\nraise tail latency. A rebuildable in-memory projection provides\nmore predictable latency but costs engineering complexity.\n\nEvolution: MVP database index → cell-sharded cache/index →\nregional custom search plane with snapshot + replay.",
      "fontSize": 17,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "PostGIS / OpenSearch / Redis GEO are strong MVP choices.\nAt high movement rates, indexing pressure and read/write coupling\nraise tail latency. A rebuildable in-memory projection provides\nmore predictable latency but costs engineering complexity.\n\nEvolution: MVP database index → cell-sharded cache/index →\nregional custom search plane with snapshot + replay.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
